## Assistants Rules

- Expose `POST /assistants/complete` for simple text completion; later add tools and memory.
- Read `OPENAI_API_KEY` from env; keep provider abstraction for future LLMs.
- Define DTOs for requests/responses in `shared.dtos` when shared across services.
- Streaming responses optional; default non-streaming for MVP.
- Safety: filter prompts minimally (no secrets); log inputs with redaction.
- Timeouts and retries wrapping API calls; exponential backoff when needed.

